Variable Score_after_overtime
Title: Score after overtime
Description: The total score of each time at the end of overtime.~
This is the game score in the case where the match does not go into overtime.
Definition: if Pre_overtime_outcome="Tie" ~
Then Scores_in_main_match+Scores_during_overti ~
Else Scores_in_main_match
